# MealKit table (AnimState). Edit it in the editor's [Tables] panel. Row id = <set>.<state>; the first row of a set is its entry state.
# Clips come from models/runner.glb (art/blender/make_models.py). Parameters are set by view/Draw.cpp drawWorld every frame:
# speed (m/s), air (1 off the ground), fuming (held after a tag), hiding, cheer; triggers: shove.
@format table 1

row runner.idle
clip idle
transitions air if air; fume if fuming; crouch if hiding; cheer if cheer; move if speed > 0.6; shove on shove

row runner.move
clip idle 0 run 4 sprint 9
blendParam speed
blendIn 0.15
transitions air if air; fume if fuming; crouch if hiding; idle if speed < 0.4; shove on shove
events 0.25 Footstep 0.75 Footstep

row runner.air
clip fall
blendIn 0.12
transitions idle if !air; shove on shove

row runner.fume
clip fume
blendIn 0.08
transitions idle if !fuming

row runner.crouch
clip crouch
loop false
blendIn 0.2
transitions idle if !hiding

row runner.shove
clip shove
loop false
blendIn 0.05
transitions idle if end

row runner.cheer
clip cheer
blendIn 0.2
transitions idle if !cheer
